Source: hpklinux
Section: unknown
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Alex Olivan <alejandro.olivan.alvarez@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12), autotools-dev
Standards-Version: 4.4.1
Homepage: https://audioscience.com

Package: hpklinux
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, dkms, linux-headers-amd64, python3
Suggests: python3-tk
Description: HPI Driver and Python Tools for AudioScience Audio Adapters
 HPI driver for the AudioScience line of professional audio adapters.
 Includes kernel DKMS driver, C and Python libraries (audioscience.hpi),
 and CLI utilities (hpicontrol, hpisave).

Package: hpklinux-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hpklinux (= @ASIHPI_PKG_VERSION@)
Description: Development files for AudioScience Audio Adapters
 Development files for the AudioScience HPI driver.
